Kraft
A Compose Multiplatform port of the Libraries.dev effects and site.

This product includes software and material from third parties. The full
licence texts ship with the app and live in
shared/src/commonMain/composeResources/files/licenses/.

Libraries.dev (https://github.com/Jakubantalik/Libraries.dev)
  Copyright (c) 2026 Jakub Antalik
  Licensed under the MIT License (LibrariesDev-MIT.txt).
  The effects in :effects (border beam, thinking orbs, bot avatars, liquid
  gooey, voice glow, metal, image generation) and the app in :shared are
  ports of its packages and site, including its spec data, bot shapes and
  demo images (gen_1.jpg, gen_2.jpg, gen_3.jpg).

Paper Shaders (https://github.com/paper-design/shaders)
  Copyright (c) Paper Design, Inc.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (PaperShaders-Apache-2.0.txt).
  The metal effect's material (effects/.../metal) is a Kotlin port of the
  `liquidMetal` fragment shader and its sizing vertex shader, which
  Libraries.dev's metal-fx consumes unmodified. The port evaluates the same
  maths on the CPU; it changes the shader's form, not its algorithm.

